      "urn": "urn:cts:copticLit:psathanasius.soul_body.budge:1-91",
      "dialect": "sahidic"
    },
    {
      "coptic": "ⲁⲩⲱ ⲙⲡⲉϥⲟⲩⲱϣ ⲉⲣⲡⲁⲓ ⲁⲗⲗⲁ ϩⲉⲛⲕⲉ**ⲕⲓⲛⲇⲩⲛⲟⲥ** · ⲛⲉⲛⲧⲁϥⲉⲣⲏⲧ ⲙⲙⲟⲟⲩ ⲉⲛⲧⲟⲩ ⲉϫⲱⲓ ⁛—",
      "english": "but he did not wish to do this, and he put before me also the dangers which he said would befall me.",
